<http://data.silknow.org/object/d1101536-1354-3a53-8ca1-99b1e33b916a>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Tapestry woven in wool and silk on a woollen warp about 18 threads to an inch. Depicting August harvesting with a man sitting on a heap of sheaves of corn in the foreground and drinking from a jug, a boy sleeps behind him, and on the left a woman is gathering sheaves and on the right a man is cutting corn with a scythe. In the middle distance a man is leading corn onto a cart. There is a village in the background on the left and a church on the right. The border contains a curling wine leaf in brown and green-yellow on a slate coloured ground. In the top border is woven a sign of the zodiac 'Virgo'. Woven into the right hand side is the Mortlake shield."@en , "Tapestry woven in wool and silk on a woollen warp, Mortlake Tapestry Factory, England, 1660-1699"@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/428b4013-7ec0-3c2e-bb69-09f42158cfec> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/9e655bf0-e2b5-3955-a11b-09ea78ad8a40> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/01648df0-25e8-3105-878c-409ea4d0b298> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Tapestry woven in wool and silk on a woollen warp about 18 threads to an inch. Depicting August harvesting with a man sitting on a heap of sheaves of corn in the foreground and drinking from a jug, a boy sleeps behind him, and on the left a woman is gathering sheaves and on the right a man is cutting corn with a scythe. In the middle distance a man is leading corn onto a cart. There is a village in the background on the left and a church on the right. The border contains a curling wine leaf in brown and green-yellow on a slate coloured ground. In the top border is woven a sign of the zodiac 'Virgo'. Woven into the right hand side is the Mortlake shield."@en , "Tapestry woven in wool and silk on a woollen warp, Mortlake Tapestry Factory, England, 1660-1699"@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/d1101536-1354-3a53-8ca1-99b1e33b916a/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/d1101536-1354-3a53-8ca1-99b1e33b916a/dimension/5> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/d1101536-1354-3a53-8ca1-99b1e33b916a/dimension/3> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/d1101536-1354-3a53-8ca1-99b1e33b916a/dimension/4> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/d1101536-1354-3a53-8ca1-99b1e33b916a/dimension/1> ;
